# Built-in logical init unit anchor (plan §1.3(9)).
#
# In M0 this is a no-op placeholder: the first-wave mounts are hardcoded in the
# binary and nothing reads this file yet. It exists so the unit directory and
# the dependency graph have their first node from the start.
#
# A target is identified by its `.target` suffix, not by a `Type=` directive:
# `Type=` belongs to `[Service]` and selects simple | oneshot | notify
# (plan §1.3(1)). Naming this file `.target` is what makes it a target.
[Unit]
Description=rinit system initialization
